'''Pyapun''' is an [[Afro-Asiatic languages|Afro-Asiatic]] language spoken in [[Plateau State]], [[Nigeria]].<ref name=e18/> It is spoken in about 10 villages east of the [[Panyam]]-[[Shendam]] road.<ref name="Blench2017">Blench, Roger. 2017. [https://www.academia.edu/35507157/CURRENT_RESEARCH_ON_THE_A3_WEST_CHADIC_LANGUAGES Current research on the A3 West Chadic languages].</ref>

